  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 18 * 3 * 12 * 9 * 3 * 111 \n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the * signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷, +, ×, –, =\n\n18 * 3 * 12 * 9 * 3 * 111 ⇒ **18 ÷ 3**__ + 12 × 9 - 3 = 111 \n\n6 + __**12 ×**____** 9**__ - 3 = 111\n\n__**6 + 108**__ - 3 = 111\n\n__**114 - 3**__ = 111\n\n111 = 111 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ×, +, ÷, –, = \n\n18 * 3 * 12 * 9 * 3 * 111 ⇒ 18 × 3 + **12 ÷ 9**__ - 3 = 111\n\n__**18 ×**____** 3**__ + 1.33 - 3 = 111\n\n__**54 + 1.33**__ - 3 = 111\n\n__**55.33 - 3**__ = 111\n\n52.33 ≠ 111 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ×, –, ×, +, = \n\n18 * 3 * 12 * 9 * 3 * 111 ⇒ **18 × 3**__ - __**12 × 9**__ + 3 = 111\n\n__**54 + 3**__ - 108 = 111\n\n__**57 - 108**__ = 111\n\n-51 ≠ 111 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ×, +, ×, –, =\n\n18 * 3 * 12 * 9 * 3 * 111 ⇒ **18 × 3**__ + __**12 × 9**__ - 3 = 111\n\n__**54 + 108**__ - 3 = 111\n\n__**162 - 3**__ = 111\n\n159 ≠ 159 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
